ecting the best local option from all available choices without regard to the g
lobal structure. Since we seek the tree of minimum weight, the natural greedy a
lgorithm for minimum spanning tree (MST) repeatedly selects the smallest weight
 edge that will enlarge the number of vertices in the tree.[] 
