 \times 10^{14}$ positions. That\TS1/lmtt/m/n/10 '\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 s far too man
y: anything larger than about $10^{9}$ positions would be unreasonable to searc
h on a modest computer in a modest amount of time.[] 
