ight order among components. Left-to-right objects include character strings, r
ooted trees, polygons, and integer sequences. Dynamic programming is best learn
ed by carefully studying examples until things start to click. I present severa
l war stories where dynamic programming played the decisive role to demonstrate
 its utility in practice.[] 
