rings, as discussed in Section 15.3 (page 448). Every leaf of the trie represen
ts one string. Each node on the path from root to leaf is labeled with exactly 
one character of the string, with the $i$ th node of the path corresponding to 
the string\TS1/lmtt/m/n/10 '\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 s $i$ th character.[] 
