icted 1 or $\infty$. Even better, use Hamiltonian path instead of cycle, so you
 never have to worry about closing up the cycle. Best of all, use Hamiltonian p
ath on directed planar graphs where each vertex has total degree 3 . All of the
se problems are equally hard, but the more you can restrict the problem that yo
u are translating from, the less work your reduction has to do.[] 
