thm in signal processing, converting an $N$-element numerical time series to an
 equivalent representation as the sum of $N$ periodic functions of different fr
equencies. Many filtering and compression algorithms on signals reduce to elimi
nating high and/or low frequency components from the Fourier transform of the s
ignal, as discussed in Section 16.11[] 
