Overfull \hbox (2017.49313pt too wide) in paragraph at lines 12063--12063
[]\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 The Handbook of Data Structures and Applications MS18 provide
s up-to-date surveys on all aspects of dictionary data structures. Other survey
s include Mehlhorn and Tsakalidis MT90b and Gonnet and Baeza-Yates GBY91. Good 
