Overfull \hbox (1151.24565pt too wide) in paragraph at lines 12063--12063
[]\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 add an edge $(i, j)$ in the incidence structure whenever vert
ex $i$ of the hypergraph appears in edge $j$ of the hypergraph. Adjacency lists
 should be used to represent this incidence structure. Drawing the associated b
ipartite graph provides a natural way to visualize the hypergraph.[] 
