Overfull \hbox (594.74727pt too wide) in paragraph at lines 12063--12063
[]\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 The 1999 DIMACS implementation challenge focused on data stru
ctures for nearest-neighbor search GJM02. Data sets and codes are accessible fr
om http://dimacs.rutgers.edu/Challenges[] 
