Overfull \hbox (1072.49588pt too wide) in paragraph at lines 12063--12063
[]\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 Projecting high-dimensional spaces onto a random lower-dimens
ional hyperplane has recently emerged as a simple but powerful method for dimen
sionality reduction. Both theoretical IMS18 and empirical BM01 results indicate
