dth, by backtracking through the set of all $n$ ! possible permutations of vert
ices. Considerable pruning can be achieved to reduce the search space by starti
ng with a good heuristic bandwidth solution and alternately adding vertices to 
the leftand rightmost open slots in the partial permutation.[] 
