Overfull \hbox (1739.24394pt too wide) in paragraph at lines 18033--18033
[]\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 Discussion: The knapsack problem arises in resource allocatio
n with financial constraints. How do you select what things to buy given a fixe
d budget? Everything has a cost and value, so we seek the most value for the gi
ven cost. The knapsack problem should invoke the image of the backpacker who is
 constrained by a fixed-size knapsack, and so must fill it with the most useful
 and portable items.[] 
