TS1/lmtt/m/n/10 '\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 t. We identify all sums that can be realized b
y performing $n$ sweeps through all $C$ elementsone for each $s_{j}, 1 \leq j \
leq n$-and so updating the array. The knapsack[] 
