codes have a particularly nice correspondence to Hamiltonian cycles on the hype
rcube. Savage [Sav97] gives an excellent survey of Gray codes (minimum change o
rderings) for a large class of combinatorial objects, including subsets. An int
eresting new approach to $k$-subset generation based on rotating bit strings wa
