o two interfering jobs are assigned the same slot. See Sections 19.7 and 19.8 .
[] 
 []


Overfull \hbox (337.49802pt too wide) in paragraph at lines 18033--18033
[]\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 - Traveling salesman identifies the most efficient delivery r
oute to visit a given set of locations. See Section 19.4 (page 594 ).[] 
