Overfull \hbox (2327.24223pt too wide) in paragraph at lines 18033--18033
[]\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 The primary algorithm for finding shortest paths is Dijkstra\
TS1/lmtt/m/n/10 '\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 s algorithm, which efficiently computes the sh
ortest path from a given starting vertex $x$ to all $n-1$ other vertices. In ea
ch iteration, it identifies a new vertex $v$ for which the shortest path from $
