ki N108. The correctness of these algorithms is based on Menger\TS1/lmtt/m/n/10
 '\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 s theorem Men27 that connectivity is determined by the number
 of edge/vertex disjoint paths separating a pair of vertices. The maximum-flow,
