ch repeated subdivision eventually produces very narrow strips, where many vert
ices get crammed into a small region of the page. Try to adjust the width of ea
ch strip to reflect the total number of nodes it will contain, and don\TS1/lmtt
/m/n/10 '\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 t be afraid of expanding into a neighboring region\TS1
/lmtt/m/n/10 '\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 s turf after their shorter subtrees have been com
pleted.[] 
