[]\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 Implementations: The reduction described above (weight 1 for 
an edge and 2 for a non-edge) turns Hamiltonian cycle into a symmetric TSP prob
lem that obeys the triangle inequality. I therefore refer the reader to the TSP
 solvers discussed in Section 19.4 (page 594). Foremost among them is Concorde,
