lidean and rectilinear Steiner tree problems in the plane by Warme et al. JWWZ1
8. It also solves the related problem of minimum spanning trees in hypergraphs,
 and claims to have solved problems as large as 10,000 points to optimality. It
 is available from http://www.geosteiner.com/. This is almost certainly the bes
t code for geometric Steiner tree instances.[] 
