[]\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 Discussion: A good first step in working with complicated geo
metric objects is to break them into simple geometric objects. This makes trian
gulation a fundamental problem in computational geometry, because the simplest 
geometric objects are triangles in two dimensions. Classical applications of tr
iangulation include finite element analysis and computer graphics.[] 
