[]\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 - Facility location - Suppose McDonald\TS1/lmtt/m/n/10 '\T1/l
mtt/m/n/10 s wants to open another restaurant. To minimize interference with ex
isting McDonald\TS1/lmtt/m/n/10 '\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 s, it should be located as far
