[]\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 - Quality triangulations - When triangulating a set of points
, we often seek nice, fat triangles that avoid small angles and skinny triangle
s. The Delaunay triangulation maximizes the minimum angle over all triangulatio
ns, and can be constructed as the dual of the Voronoi diagram. See Section 20.3
