n the plane into a set of cones in three dimensions, such that the Voronoi diag
ram is defined by projecting the cones back onto the plane. Advantages of Fortu
ne\TS1/lmtt/m/n/10 '\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 s algorithm include that (a) it runs in opt
imal $\Theta(n \log n)$ time, (b) it is reasonable to implement, and (c) we nee
