[410]
Overfull \hbox (1665.74416pt too wide) in paragraph at lines 18033--18033
[]\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 - Geometric data - Recall that the Voronoi diagram of a point
 set $S$ (see Section 20.4 (page 634) decomposes the plane into regions around 
each point $s_{i} \in S$ such that all points within the region around $s_{i}$ 
are closer to $s_{i}$ than to any other site in $S$. Similarly, the Voronoi dia
gram of a set of line segments $L$ decomposes the plane into regions around eac
h line[] 
 []


Overfull \hbox (326.99805pt too wide) in paragraph at lines 18033--18033
[]\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 segment $l_{i} \in L$ such that all points within the region 
around $l_{i}$ are closer to $l_{i}$ than to any other site in $L$.[] 
