th applications. It is an essential reference for anyone seriously interested i
n the subject. Recent surveys of combinatorial and algorithmic results include 
AS00 HS18. Good expositions on constructing arrangements include dBvKOS08 O\TS1
/lmtt/m/n/10 '\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 R01. Implementation issues related to arrangement
