 way to prove that any modification to a document is fraudulent. Digital signat
ures are a cryptographic way for me to stamp my document as genuine, and play a
n important role in maintaining the integrity of the blockchain associated with
 cryptocurrencies like Bitcoin.[] 
 []


Overfull \hbox (2295.74232pt too wide) in paragraph at lines 18033--18033
