 modest. The recognition that industry is using a particular code is important 
to the authors, often more important than the money involved. Do the right thin
g and get a license. Information about terms or whom to contact is usually avai
lable embedded within the documentation, or available at the source\TS1/lmtt/m/
n/10 '\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 s website.[] 
