s efficient and reliable geometric algorithms in $\mathrm{C}++$. It is very com
prehensive, offering a rich variety of triangulations, Voronoi diagrams, operat
ions on polygons and polyhedra, line/curve arrangements, alpha-shapes, convex-h
ull algorithms, and geometric search structures. Many work in three dimensions 
and beyond.[] 
